<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">The Better You Learn, The Smarter You Prune: Towards Efficient Vision-language-action Models via Differentiable Token Pruning
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
